on</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Feinberg</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><article-title>Intra-individual change over time in DNA methylation with familial clustering.</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2008</year><volume>299</volume><fpage>2877</fpage><lpage>2883</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.299.24.2877</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18577732</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>Draft Guidance for Industry, Clinical Laboratories, and FDA Staff - <italic>In Vitro </italic>Diagnostic Multivariate Index Assays</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.fda.gov/cdrh/oivd/guidance/1610.html">http://www.fda.gov/cdrh/oivd/guidance/1610.html</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>